+Feature: Clear completed button
+  The clear completed button removes completed todos and hides when none exist.
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes completed todos
+    Given the todo application with completed todos "Buy milk" and active todos "Walk the dog"
+    When the user clicks the clear completed button
+    Then a todo with text "Buy milk" is not visible in the list
+    And a todo with text "Walk the dog" is visible in the list
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Clear completed hides when no completed todos
+    Given the todo application with todos "Buy milk"
+    Then the clear completed button is not visible
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Clear completed shows when completed todos exist
+    Given the todo application with completed todos "Buy milk"
+    Then the clear completed button is visible
