+    Then the counter shows "0 items left"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Counter shows singular for one item
+    Given the todo application with todos "Buy milk"
+    Then the counter shows "1 item left"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Counter shows plural for multiple items
+    Given the todo application with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    Then the counter shows "2 items left"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Counter excludes completed items
+    Given the todo application with todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user marks the todo "Buy milk" as completed
+    Then the counter shows "1 item left"
+
